invalid type: string "8.2 Multiple Linear Regression\nWhile Simple Linear Regression models the relationship between a response variable and a\nsingle predictor,Multiple Linear Regressionextends this to include multiple independent\nvariables. This allows us to control for confounding variables and improve predictive accuracy.\nThe model takes the form:\nY=β 0 +β 1X1 +β 2X2 +· · ·+β nXn +ϵ